claim.claim-text:
configuring (S701) a user equipment, UE, measurement procedure;
receiving (S702) a measurement report from a UE;
deciding (S703) to handover the UE based on the measurement report;
transmitting (S704) a handover request message to a target gNB,
wherein the handover request message includes 1) a quality of service, QoS, flow-to-data radio bearer, DRB, mapping rule applied to the UE, and 2) other parameters, and
wherein the QoS flow-to-DRB mapping rule is used for mapping a DRB to one or more QoS flows at the source gNB; and
receiving (S706) a handover request acknowledge message from the target gNB in response to the handover request message,
wherein the handover request acknowledge message includes information indicating that the target gNB decides to use the same QoS flow-to-DRB mapping rule as the source gNB.

a transceiver (1513);
a processor (1511); and
a memory (1512) operably connectable to the processor (1511) and storing instructions that, based on being executed by the processor (1511), perform operations comprising:

configuring a user equipment, UE, measurement procedure;
receiving a measurement report from a UE;
deciding to handover the UE based on the measurement report;
transmitting a handover request message to a target gNB,
wherein the handover request message includes 1) a quality of service, QoS, flow-to-data radio bearer, DRB, mapping rule applied to the UE, and 2) other parameters, and
wherein the QoS flow-to-DRB mapping rule is used for mapping a DRB to one or more QoS flows at the source gNB; and
receiving a handover request acknowledge message from the target gNB in response to the handover request message,
wherein the handover request acknowledge message includes information indicating that the target gNB decides to use the same QoS flow-to-DRB mapping rule as the source gNB.
